summary.text:
Register an entity's actions in the command palette while the caller is mounted — the
selected row, the open endpoint page (R12.1). They appear under the target's name;
submenu actions flatten to "Power › Restart". Memoise

Group the rows (server-side, docs/data-filters.md §7): a header row per group with its
count from the server, which collapses (click, Enter or Space; ← and → on the header;
Alt-click toggles every group). Each expanded group shows its first

): collapsed groups and each group's "Show more" count.
Sorting or filtering returns every group to its first page, as it returns a flat table
to page 1; collapsed groups stay collapsed. Absent: every group expanded, first page.

A small lock beside the label of a setting that needs MFA to change (PrivilegedWrite,
): reassignment, credentials, routing, removal. Saving a change to one asks for
step-up first ("Verify and save"). Reads never do.

 run broadest first (workspace) to narrowest
last (the entity being edited). The broadest level that enforces a value wins outright;
otherwise the narrowest level that sets a value wins.

A text-like control's content width (R15.6). full (default) fills the form column;
short fits about 8 characters (port, year, PIN); medium about 24rem (title, name,
hostname). Never widen a control to fill a row beside another.

